{title: 304 - Faith of Our Fathers}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #304 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 304}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G/D]Faith [D7/C]of [Em/B]our fathers, [Am]living [D7/C]still,
[G]In spite [C/G]of [G]dungeon, [Em]fire and [A7]sword;
[G/D]O [D7/C]how [Em/B]our hearts [G]beat [D7/C]high [C]with [D/A]joy
[G]Whenever we hear that glorious Word!
[C/E]Faith of our [G/D]fathers, [D]holy [G/D]faith!
[G]We [F#dim]will [G]be [C/G]true [G]to thee [F#dim]till [G]death.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G/D]Our [D7/C]fathers, [Em/B]chained in [Am]prisons [D7/C]dark,
[G]Were still [C/G]in [G]heart and [Em]conscience [A7]free:
[G/D]How [D7/C]sweet [Em/B]would be [G]their [D7/C]children's [D/A]fate.
[G]If they, [C/G]like [G]them, could die for [F#dim]thee!
[C/E]Faith of our [G/D]fathers, [D]holy [G/D]faith!
[G]We [F#dim]will [G]be [C/G]true [G]to thee [F#dim]till [G]death.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G/D]Faith [D7/C]of [Em/B]our fathers, [Am]we will [D7/C]love
[G]Both friend [C/G]and [G]foe in [Em]all our [A7]strife;
[G/D]And [D7/C]preach [Em/B]Thee, too, [G]as [D7/C]love [C]knows [D/A]how
[G]By kindly words and virtuous [F#dim]life.
[C/E]Faith of our [G/D]fathers, [D]holy [G/D]faith!
[G]We [F#dim]will [G]be [C/G]true [G]to thee [F#dim]till [G]death.
{end_of_verse}
